  "solution": "<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/e4ca80fe1923e2b4260775077c7cd30b8987fd242030df012f359eb772b10f62.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tGiải sử hình chóp tứ giác đều <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> tượng trưng cho kim tự tháp. Khi đó cạnh bên có độ dài là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>32</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math> m, cạnh đáy có độ dài là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>36</mn></semantics></math> m.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> là giao của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông góc với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>. Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là đường cao của hình chóp.<br>Xét tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math>, ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>36</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>D</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>32</mn><mo>,</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>18</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>≈</mo><mn>19</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></semantics></math> (m).",
